    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structllvm_1_1_d_o_t_graph_traits" kindref="compound">DOTGraphTraits</ref> - Template class that can be specialized to customize how graphs are converted to &apos;dot&apos; graphs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When specializing, you may inherit from <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_default_d_o_t_graph_traits" kindref="compound">DefaultDOTGraphTraits</ref> if you don&apos;t need to override everything. </para>
